==NPCs and professions==
The vast majority of [[Non-player character|NPCs]] combatants in Prophecies, Factions and Nightfall only use skills from a single profession; however, many NPCs in Eye of the North and a few NPCs in the campaigns have [[:Category:NPCs with multiple professions|skills from two or more professions]]. There are also a few NPCs with their own [[monster skill]]s that do not belong to any profession.

